OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse perpetrators 'don't
OL,4,Afear the system', says Commissioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe response to domestic abuse-related
OL,7,Fsuicides must improve, the Domestic
OL,8,FAbuse Commissioner has told BBC News,
OL,9,Fwarning perpetrators will continue to
OL,10,Foffend unless they fear the
OL,11,Fconsequences of their actions.
OL,13,FNicole Jacobs' comments come as the
OL,14,Fsister of a 23-year-old woman who died
OL,15,Fby suicide says she believes domestic
OL,16,Fabuse was a factor which led to her
OL,17,Fdeath, despite the court not linking it
OL,18,Fdirectly.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
