OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse perpetrators 'don't
OL,4,Afear the system', says Commissioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FSkye Nicholls from Liss, Hampshire,
OL,7,Fdied in 2023 and her partner, James
OL,8,FEdwards, pleaded guilty to two counts
OL,9,Fof controlling or coercive behaviour.
OL,11,FA government spokesperson said: "This
OL,12,Fis a tragic loss which underlines the
OL,13,Fdevastating impact abusive behaviour
OL,14,Fcan have."
